  Slug: animal-wrangler
  DisplayName: Animal Wrangler
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: 'You have a long history of working with large circus animals for
    the Celestial Menagerie, such as performing in an animal act, jostling animals
    back into their cages, or even sweeping dung out of squalid pens. Mistress Dusklight''s
    ongoing mistreatment of her animals compelled you to quit, and you now strive
    to ensure animals aren''t abused. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to
    Strength or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute boost. You''re trained in your
    choice of the Athletics or Nature skills. You gain a skill feat: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Titan
    Wrestler] if you chose Athletics, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Train
    Animal] if you chose Nature. You are also trained in a Lore skill related to
    a particular kind of common animal (such as Equine Lore, Feline Lore, or Pachyderm
    Lore).'
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Extinction Curse Player's Guide
  SourcePack: backgrounds
  Rarity: common
